# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 5bf09ff4e15fd066c9698d42e0efb337eca6b33431ae75ffe086b6866e772900
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server b31d9c711d2718fe32ebbf4060e7176abae687f95debf676bd1d413b74e32bbd
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 07cd8291089d0a2ba76c814fb2abf58fc6084e85840a1b7aae93c5e8babd416f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 86eb35221c6a4f82553ee50f370c9ba930c2763c4e5a7f6e05c62490c5f1994d
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 9917206cd8fdaa2e0bc61b2ef1daa9f844bcba40ec68456f6d9dc2318da84dd2
